    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eliya Kūhwehulwa Kūtwalwa Ng'wigūlū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lwene ū SEEBA wantwalaga ū Eliya ng'wigūlū mu nzīla ya nyaga gwa nshūlūūlū, ū Eliya nū Elisha bashimīzaga hamò kūfuma Giligaali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Eliya ūng'wīla ū Elisha, “Ikalaga henaha nguno ū SEEBA wanitūmaga kūja Beeseli.” Ū Elisha ūhaya, “Ūmo SEEBA alī mpanga, na gīt'ūmo bebe ūlī mpanga, natīko ū kūkūleka.” Na lūūlū būja dege būūkashika ī Beeseli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bashika koi, a bahangi ba Beeseli būng'wīla ū Elisha, “Ūmanile gīkī ū SEEBA alīkwīngīja ū so būgonzo ī lelo?” Ū Elisha ūhaya, “Namanile huumūlagi dūhū a bing'we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Eliya ūng'wīla, “Ikalaga henaha Elisha, nguno ū SEEBA wanitūmaga kūja Yeliko.” Ū Elisha ūhaya, “Ūmo SEEBA alī mpanga, na gīt'ūmo bebe ūlī mpanga, natīko ū kūkūleka.” Na lūūlū būja dege būūkashika ī Yeliko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bashika koi, a bahangi ba Yeliko būng'wīl'ū Elisha, “Ūmanile gīkī ū SEEBA alīkwīngīja ū so būgonzo ī lelo?” Ū Elisha ūhaya, “Namanile huumūlagi dūhū a bing'we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Eliya ūng'wīla, “Ikalaga henaha nguno ū SEEBA wanitūmaga kūja kū mongo gwa Yolodani.” Ū Elisha ūhaya, “Ūmo SEEBA alī mpanga, na gīt'ūmo bebe ūlī mpanga, natīko ū kūkūleka.” Na lūūlū būshimīza dege bajile kū būtongi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banhū makūmi atanò ū ng'wibità lya bahangī būbalondeela; gwike bīmīīla ka kūle hoi hado balolelile ū kū mongo gwa Yolodani, ūko walī ū Eliya nū Elisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Eliya ūgūsola ū ng'wenda ūyo walī igumīīlile, ūgūlingalinga, hūna ūgūtūmammīla kūgatūla a minzī; gūgabanhīka kū būlyo na kū lūmoso, būbīta būbīlī wabo balīshimīza hasī nyūmu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bakīla, ū Eliya ūng'wīla ū Elisha, “Niwīlage ū mhayo ūyo ūlītogwa nakwītīle aho nataalī kūsolwa nakwīngīle.” Ū Elisha ūhaya, “Nalīlomba napandīke ng'hangala ibīlī ngabo gwa moyo ūyo gūlī mulī bebe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Eliya ūhaya, “Walomba mhayo ndimu, alīyo ūlū ūnibona a h'ikanza īlo nalīsolwa kūkwīngīla, ū mhayo gwenūyo gūkūbiza gwako, gwike ūlū ītī chene numho ndūhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bakūshimīzaga kūnū bakūlūngalūngaga, kwimanīla lilonga igogoteni lya moto na falasa ja moto, lyūbalekanya, ū Eliya ūhwehulwa nyaga gwa nshūūlūlū kūja ng'wigūlya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Elisha ūgūbona ū mhayo gwenūyū; ūlīla alīhaya, “Baba! Baba! Magogoteni ga Isilaeli, na badamhīji ba falasa ba Isilaeli!” Ū Elisha atamonile hangī ilalī. Hūna ūshidima ī shizwalo shakwe, ūshitandūla habīlī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elisha kwandya būtūmami bokwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūgūsola ū ng'wenda ūyo gūkalagala kūfuma kūlī Eliya, ūshoka ūja nago ūkīmīīla a ha lūgegu lwa mongo gwa Yolodani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ng'wenda ūyo akagūlagaja Eliya ūgūdima ūgatūla a minzī nū ng'wenda gwenūyo; kūnū alībūūja, “Alīhalī ū SEEBA, ū Mulungu o ng'wa Eliya?” Aho wagatūla a minzī gūgabanhīka kū būlyo na kū lūmoso, ūgūkīla ū mongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bahangi ba Yeliko abo balolaga bīmīīlaga ka kūle būhaya, “Ū būdūla bo ng'wa Moyo ūbo walī mulī Eliya ī haha būlī mulī Elisha!” Hūna būnsūng'wanha, bahayūshika aho walī binama ū kū būtongi wakwe kūshisha hasī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būng'wīla, “Baba a bise batūmami bako tūlī na bagosha makūmi atanò ba nguzu. Leka baje bakankoobe ū so būgonzo; hamo ū Moyo o ng'wa SEEBA adūgije kūbiza wamūūchaga ūūkaneka mu lūgūlū lūlebe nūūlū kū mahululu malebe.” Ū Elisha ūlema alīhaya, “Yaya ū kūbatūma.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike būng'wiyandīīla no, nose ūcha minala ū kwikala alīlema. Na lūūlū ūhaya, “Batūmagi naheene baje lūūlū.” Būtūma banhū makūmi atanò, būūkamala shikū idatū bakūkoobaga, būlemeelwa ū kūmpandīka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būshoka ū kūlī Elisha, walī Yeliko; ūbawīla, “Natamulemegije ū kūja?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elisha na minzī malūlū kūbiza manonu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba mu nzengo gwenūyo būng'wīla ū Elisha, “Baba būgonzo ūlīgūbona ū nzengo gwenūyū gīkī gūlī ha soga jigi jigi; alīyo a minzī gaho mabi no, nī sī ītabbiishaga ī shilīwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbawīla, “Nenhelagi ibbakuli ipya aha.” Būng'wenhela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūja ū kū lūzwīlo lwa minzī ūūkiitīla ko munhu; hūna ūhaya, “Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, ‘Aminzī genaya nagapījaga. Gatenha lūfu hangī, nūūlū gatūyenheleja ī sī īleke kūbbiisha shilīwa.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana kūfuma lwise lwenūlo a minzī genayo gūbeela kūshisha na lelo īyī; gīt'ūmo gwalī ū mhayo ūyo akagūyomba Elisha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elisha kūbazuma abo baamelaga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Elisha wīnga a henaho ūja kū nzengo gwa Beeseli, aho alī ū mu nzīla ajile, bayanda balebe bafumaga mu nzengo bandya kūmela balīng'wīla, “Bebe o wanga, inungage ng'wigūlya! O wanga, inungage ng'wigūlya!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūgalūka ūbalola, aho wababona ūbazuma mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA. Jūpuluka ndūba ibīlī kūfuma mu masaka jūbasaasagūla bayanda makūmi anè na babīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei ūgoloola ajile kū lūgūlū lwa Kalimeli, wahayīnga ū kwenūko, ūshoka Samalia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
